{"sha": "a2dda1613d0d6f047259d4ae94a2d05291c7c23e622a767d35d143f0e232f3be", "body": ["\\begin{proof}", "由\\cref{thm:g11:quad:canonical}中算出的顶点式出发：", "\\[", "ax^2+bx+c", "= a\\left(x + \\frac{b}{2a}\\right)^2 + c - \\frac{b^2}{4a}", "= a\\left[\\left(x + \\frac{b}{2a}\\right)^2 - \\frac{\\Delta}{4a^2}\\right],", "\\]", "因为 $c - \\frac{b^2}{4a} = \\frac{4ac - b^2}{4a} = -\\frac{\\Delta}{4a} =", "a \\times \\left(-\\frac{\\Delta}{4a^2}\\right)$。", "", "\\emph{1.} 若 $\\Delta > 0$，则 $\\frac{\\Delta}{4a^2} =", "\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt\\Delta}{2a}\\right)^2$，且括号部分是", "两个平方之差：", "\\[", "ax^2+bx+c = a\\left(x + \\frac{b}{2a} - \\frac{\\sqrt\\Delta}{2a}\\right)", "\\left(x + \\frac{b}{2a} + \\frac{\\sqrt\\Delta}{2a}\\right)", "= a(x - x_2)(x - x_1).", "\\]", "乘积为零，当且仅当其中某个因式为零，由此得出", "两个根，因 $\\sqrt\\Delta \\neq 0$，二者互异。", "", "\\emph{2.} 若 $\\Delta = 0$，则括号部分为", "$\\left(x + \\frac{b}{2a}\\right)^2$，它仅在", "$x_0 = -\\frac{b}{2a}$ 处为零。", "", "\\emph{3.} 若 $\\Delta < 0$，则 $-\\frac{\\Delta}{4a^2} > 0$，因此括号部分", "是一个平方加一个正数，故永不为零，方程", "无实数解。若能分解为 $a(x-x_1)(x-x_2)$，则会产生根，因此", "这样的分解不存在。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{example}\\label{ex:g11:quad:solving}", "解方程 $2x^2 - 8x + 3 = 0$。此时 $\\Delta = (-8)^2 - 4 \\times 2 \\times 3 =", "64 - 24 = 40 > 0$，故方程有两个根：", "\\[", "x_{1,2} = \\frac{8 \\pm \\sqrt{40}}{4} = \\frac{8 \\pm 2\\sqrt{10}}{4}", "= 2 \\pm \\frac{\\sqrt{10}}{2}.", "\\]", "对于 $x^2 + x + 1 = 0$，$\\Delta = 1 - 4 = -3 < 0$，无实数解。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[根的和与积]\\label{prop:g11:quad:vieta}", "若 $\\Delta \\geq 0$，且 $x_1, x_2$ 为其根（$\\Delta = 0$ 时二者相等），", "则", "\\[", "x_1 + x_2 = -\\frac{b}{a},", "\\qquad", "x_1 x_2 = \\frac{c}{a} .", "\\]", "反之，和为 $s$、积为 $p$ 的两个数，即", "$x^2 - sx + p = 0$ 的两个解。", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "将\\cref{thm:g11:quad:roots}中的因式分解展开：", "\\[", "a(x - x_1)(x - x_2) = a x^2 - a(x_1 + x_2)x + a\\,x_1 x_2 .", "\\]", "比较 $ax^2 + bx + c$ 的系数，得", "$-a(x_1+x_2) = b$ 与 $a\\,x_1x_2 = c$。反之，若 $u + v = s$ 且", "$uv = p$，则 $(x-u)(x-v) = x^2 - sx + p$，故 $u$、$v$ 为其根。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{example}", "求和为 $10$、积为 $21$ 的两个数。它们满足", "$x^2 - 10x + 21 = 0$；$\\Delta = 100 - 84 = 16$，根为", "$\\frac{10 \\pm 4}{2} = 7$ 与 $3$。\\emph{快速找根：}由于", "$x^2 - 5x + 4$ 的系数满足 $1 - 5 + 4 = 0$，故数 $1$ 是一个", "根，另一根为 $\\frac{c}{a} = 4$（两根之积必为", "$\\frac ca$）。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\section{二次三项式的符号}", "", "\\begin{theorem}[二次三项式的符号]\\label{thm:g11:quad:sign}", "设 $f(x) = ax^2+bx+c$，其中 $a \\neq 0$。", "\\begin{enumerate}", "  \\item 若 $\\Delta > 0$，根为 $x_1 < x_2$，则 $f(x)$ 与 $a$ 同号的", "        部分是 $\\intcc{x_1}{x_2}$ 之外，与 $-a$ 同号的", "        部分是 $\\intoo{x_1}{x_2}$。", "  \\item 若 $\\Delta = 0$，则 $f(x)$ 与 $a$ 同号，对一切 $x \\neq x_0$", "        成立，且在 $x_0$ 处为零。", "  \\item 若 $\\Delta < 0$，则 $f(x)$ 与 $a$ 同号，对一切 $x$ 成立。", "\\end{enumerate}", "简言之：\\emph{二次三项式与 $a$ 同号，两根之间除外}。", "\\end{theorem}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "\\emph{1.} 写 $f(x) = a(x-x_1)(x-x_2)$，并考察各因式的", "符号。若 $x < x_1$，则 $x - x_1$ 与 $x - x_2$ 均为负，其", "积为正，故 $f(x)$ 与 $a$ 同号。若 $x_1 < x < x_2$，两因式", "异号，积为负，故 $f(x)$ 与 $-a$ 同号。若 $x > x_2$，两因式", "均为正，故 $f(x)$ 仍与", "$a$ 同号。", "", "\\emph{2.} $f(x) = a(x - x_0)^2$，且 $(x-x_0)^2 > 0$，只要 $x \\neq x_0$。", "", "\\emph{3.} 由\\cref{thm:g11:quad:roots}的证明，", "$f(x) = a\\left[\\left(x + \\frac{b}{2a}\\right)^2 +", "\\left(-\\frac{\\Delta}{4a^2}\\right)\\right]$，括号部分", "恒为正。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{method}[解二次不等式]\\label{met:g11:quad:inequalities}", "求解 $ax^2 + bx + c \\leq 0$（或 $\\geq$、$<$、$>$），步骤如下：", "\\begin{enumerate}", "  \\item 计算 $\\Delta$，若有根则求出根；", "  \\item 利用\\cref{thm:g11:quad:sign}列出符号表（", "        根之外取 $a$ 的符号）；", "  \\item 写出解区间，并注意根本身是否属于解集", "        （非严格不等式时属于，严格不等式时不属于）。", "\\end{enumerate}", "\\end{method}", ""]}